  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The global standard for portable patient summaries — ISO 27269 + HL7 FHIR R4 IG, mandated by the EU for cross-border health data exchange (eHDSI / myHealth@EU) and referenced in the EU Health Data Space regulation. CC0 licensed. Any team building care transition, cross-border, or patient-facing health data flows should implement IPS as the minimum patient context payload.",
